# Files executed inside Linux containers or by bash must keep LF endings, even
# when the repository is cloned on Windows with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF
# `set -euo pipefail\r` aborts the Postgres init script half-way and leaves a
# database without `tenant_template`, which makes every registration fail.
#
# Deliberately NOT `* text=auto`: a few source files are CRLF in the index and
# renormalizing them would rewrite unrelated history.
*.sh                text eol=lf
*.sql               text eol=lf
*.nsh               text eol=lf
database/**         text eol=lf
docker-compose*.yml text eol=lf
